+# Corpus fetch limits
+
+Per-domain rate limit the fetch had to respect: **12 visits per 60 s window**, with a **900 s (15 min) cooldown** imposed after a breach.
+
+## Mirror/CDN hosts used
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` — primary mirror; confirmed by `manifest.tsv`'s header, which records files as "fetched raw via raw.githubusercontent.com".
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path` — secondary mirror.
+- `cdn.statically.io` — tertiary mirror; noted as slow/prone to timeouts.
+
+Source: this project's own session record (Svipall rate-limit note), not anything checked into this repo's history.
